		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:04,740",
				"to": "00:09:09,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 544740,
				"to": 549740
			},
			"text": " >> Let us actually have the tape of that we're gonna look at it now as you continue to describe what you have seen."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:09,740",
				"to": "00:09:11,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 549740,
				"to": 551420
			},
			"text": " We're looking at the tape now, Jeff."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:11,420",
				"to": "00:09:19,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 551420,
				"to": 559740
			},
			"text": " >> Okay, good, this once again happened only within the last few minutes we saw one of those smaller buildings just fall to the ground."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:19,740",
				"to": "00:09:22,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 559740,
				"to": 562740
			},
			"text": " We had heard earlier that it was structurally unsafe at the-"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:22,740",
				"to": "00:09:29,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 562740,
				"to": 569740
			},
			"text": " [BLANK_AUDIO]"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:29,740",
