		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:40,740",
				"to": "00:09:43,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 580740,
				"to": 583740
			},
			"text": " >> We might have had something on the ground, Ashley."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:43,740",
				"to": "00:09:49,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 583740,
				"to": 589700
			},
			"text": " >> Well, at first we had thought, Brian, that we'd heard another explosion, but I think it's just another truck that's heading down to the south side."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:49,700",
				"to": "00:09:52,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 589700,
				"to": 592700
			},
			"text": " I just wanted to let you know that we're starting to see people moving north."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:52,700",
				"to": "00:09:57,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 592700,
				"to": 597700
			},
			"text": " In fact, you were just told by police that you should move out of your apartment, Saviana."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:57,700",
				"to": "00:09:58,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 597700,
				"to": 598700
			},
			"text": " You've got Carolina here?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:58,700",
				"to": "00:09:59,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 598700,
				"to": 599700
			},
			"text": " >> Yes."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:59,700",
				"to": "00:10:03,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 599700,
				"to": 603700
			},
			"text": " >> They advise us to leave because we have- >> My God."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:03,700",
				"to": "00:10:06,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 603700,
				"to": 606700
			},
			"text": " Look behind us, please pan in this way, please be careful of your baby."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:06,700",
				"to": "00:10:07,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 606700,
				"to": 607700
			},
			"text": " This is it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:07,700",
				"to": "00:10:08,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 607700,
				"to": 608700
			},
			"text": " >> That's the building coming down."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:08,700",
				"to": "00:10:14,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 608700,
				"to": 614700
			},
			"text": " >> My God, my God, my God, no, listen, we'll be all right, we'll be all right."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:14,700",
				"to": "00:10:19,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 614700,
				"to": 619700
			},
			"text": " >> All right, Ashley, Ashley, I think we're okay."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:19,700",
				"to": "00:10:23,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 619700,
				"to": 623700
			},
			"text": " >> All right, we're gonna have to move this way, we're gonna have to move, we're gonna have to move, that cloud is coming this way."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:23,700",
				"to": "00:10:30,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 623700,
				"to": 630700
			},
			"text": " >> Yeah, Ashley, get out of there, leave the camera on man if you need to and get out of there."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:30,700",
				"to": "00:10:36,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 630700,
				"to": 636700
			},
			"text": " What we've been fearing all afternoon has apparently happened, we were watching number seven World Trade,"
		},
