			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:36,700",
				"to": "00:10:43,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 636700,
				"to": 643700
			},
			"text": " which was part of the ancillary damage of the explosion and collapse of the other two."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:43,700",
				"to": "00:10:48,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 643700,
				"to": 648700
			},
			"text": " We've been talking all day about how fast these plumes of smoke move."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:48,700",
				"to": "00:10:52,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 648700,
				"to": 652700
			},
			"text": " And you're watching one on the move right now that is building dust."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:52,700",
				"to": "00:11:00,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 652700,
				"to": 660700
			},
			"text": " Look at the wider shot on the left from across the river in New York."
