			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:21,700",
				"to": "00:11:25,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 681700,
				"to": 685700
			},
			"text": " >> I'm at the corner of Northmore Street and Greenwich Street."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:25,700",
				"to": "00:11:28,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 685700,
				"to": 688700
			},
			"text": " >> Can you confirm it was number seven that just went in?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:28,700",
				"to": "00:11:29,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 688700,
				"to": 689700
			},
			"text": " >> Yes, sir."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:29,700",
				"to": "00:11:32,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 689700,
				"to": 692700
			},
			"text": " >> And you guys knew this was coming all day."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:32,700",
				"to": "00:11:39,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 692700,
				"to": 699700
			},
			"text": " We had heard reports that the building was unstable and that it was the best thing we needed to come down on its own,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:39,700",
				"to": "00:11:41,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 699700,
				"to": 701700
			},
			"text": " or it would be taken down."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:41,700",
				"to": "00:11:44,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 701700,
				"to": 704700
			},
			"text": " I would imagine it came down on its own."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:44,700",
				"to": "00:11:52,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 704700,
				"to": 712700
			},
			"text": " And we are just awaiting now at our triage for any of the casualties or any other injuries."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:52,700",
				"to": "00:11:54,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 712700,
				"to": 714700
			},
			"text": " >> I wonder if you have another hijack plane crash."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:54,700",
				"to": "00:11:56,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 714700,
				"to": 716700
			},
			"text": " CDS base corresponded by the water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:56,700",
				"to": "00:12:03,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 716700,
				"to": 723700
			},
			"text": " It was one very interesting thing, we just were, and it's about to play with crash in Pennsylvania."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:03,700",
				"to": "00:12:09,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 723700,
				"to": 729700
			},
			"text": " >> This made sure that you're here at WCBS, a WCBS time, 542."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:09,700",
				"to": "00:12:13,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 729700,
				"to": 733700
			},
			"text": " The American Red Cross is going to have four shelters all day long."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:13,700",
				"to": "00:12:17,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 733700,
				"to": 737700
			},
			"text": " >> I think one just collapsed, one of the other buildings."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:17,700",
				"to": "00:12:27,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 737700,
				"to": 747700
			},
			"text": " >> All right, that is not good."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:27,700",
				"to": "00:12:31,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 747700,
				"to": 751700
			},
			"text": " >> Yeah."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:31,700",
				"to": "00:12:32,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 751700,
				"to": 752700
			},
			"text": " >> Building was on fire."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:32,700",
				"to": "00:12:35,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 752700,
				"to": 755700
			},
			"text": " Building number seven at the trade complex has now apparently collapsed."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:35,700",
				"to": "00:12:40,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 755700,
				"to": 760700
			},
			"text": " >> Also, reports of building number five might be on fire too, but now a huge amount of smoking to breathe now"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:40,700",
				"to": "00:12:43,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 760700,
				"to": 763700
			},
			"text": " from up in that area again because of this building number seven going down."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:43,700",
				"to": "00:12:49,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 763700,
				"to": 769700
			},
			"text": " Governor Pajor is attacking on the line with us once again, and Governor Pajor is the latest information you've got for us."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:49,700",
				"to": "00:12:56,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 769700,
				"to": 776700
			},
			"text": " >> Well, New York has been pulling together to respond to this emergency, and I just was thanking people who are donating blood"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:56,700",
				"to": "00:13:01,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 776700,
				"to": 781700
			},
			"text": " and to bring in hospital, but over the course of the next few days, we're going to need more help."
		}
	]
}
